<title>SWEDEN: Volvo Truck starts Pakistan output April.</title>
<headline>Volvo Truck starts Pakistan output April.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Volvo Truck will start production from its new factory in Pakistan next April, a company spokesman said on Friday.</p>
<p>The assembly plant at Lahore, a joint venture with local company Swedish Motors (Pvt) Ltd, will produce 200-300 FL10 trucks a year for sale in Pakistan where there are currently about 1,000 Volvo trucks in operation.</p>
<p>Spokesman Stefan Lorentzson said the joint venture, Volvo Pakistan Ltd, would also run two wholly-owned sales and after-sales centres in Pakistan.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1045</p>
